  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n[(26 div (4)/(2)) times left{8 div 2 times (12-2)/(5)right} div {4 times 4 div 3}]\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (26 ÷ (4 ÷ 2)) = 26 ÷ 2 = 13\n\n⇒ {8 ÷ 2 × ((12 − 2) ÷ 5)} = 4 × (10 ÷ 5) = 4 × 2 = 8\n\n⇒ {4 × 4 ÷ 3} = 16 ÷ 3 = 16/3\n\n⇒ [13 × 8 ÷ (16/3)] = 104 ÷ (16/3) = 104 × 3/16\n\n⇒ 312/16 = 19.5\n\n**∴ Value = 19.5**",
